   SinOsc s1 => 0.1, 440 => Delay(0.5) => dac;

4. **Loops and Conditionals**: Loops allow repeated execution of code, while conditionals control flow based on logical tests.

   // Loop example
   while (true) {
       SinOsc s1 => 0.1, 440 => dac;
       0.1 => clock;
   }

   // Conditional example
   if (rand(0, 1) == 1) {
       SinOsc s1 => 0.1, 440 => dac;
   } else {
       SinOsc s1 => 0.1, 880 => dac;
   }
